Companies are invited to provide views on whether the above TP from Qualcomm is supported Regarding the QCL/TCI state for LP-WUS in CONNECTED mode, following agreements were made in previous RAN1 meetings: Following views are provided in the contributions: Ofinno P1: Update Section 10.4D to add that the UE should refer to the most recent TCI state also indicated by RRC P2: Clarify the UE should use the first TCI state for LP-WUS monitoring in the case that the indicated CORESTE has two activated TCI states Sharp: P3: Further discussion is needed on the definition of the application time for LP-WUS that spans multiple slots. In particular, clarification should be made to ensure that a TCI state change does not occur mid-way through an LP-WUS duration, which could result in different portions of the same LP-WUS being received with different QCL parameters

