3GPP TSG-RAN WG1 Meeting #92 R1-1803508 Athens, Greece, February 26 – March 2, 2018 Title: [DRAFT] LS on Simultaneous PDSCH Reception with Paging Response to: - Release: Rel-15 Work Item: NR_newRAT Source: Qualcomm [RAN1] To: RAN2 Cc: - Contact Person: Name: Joseph Soriaga E-mail Address: jsoriaga@qti.qualcomm.com 1. Overall Description RAN1 would like to inform RAN2 of the following agreement. Working assumption: P-RNTI PDSCH is not required to be decoded by UE in RRC_CONNECTED mode Note: P-RNTI PDCCH may not schedule a P-RNTI PDSCH but rather carries the message by itself, which may be used for e.g. systemInfoModification, cmas-Indication, and etws-Indication Send an LS to RAN2 asking for feedback (R1-1803508) 2. Actions: RAN1 respectfully asks RAN2 to provide feedback on this agreement. 3. Date of Next RAN1 Meetings: TSG-RAN WG1 Meeting #92b 16 – 20 April 2018 Sanya, China TSG-RAN WG1 Meeting #93 21 - 25 May 2018 Busan, Korea

